# Peerless Ropemaster: "When this creature enters, return up to one target tapped creature to its owner's hand." On turn 1
# Bot1 casts the first Ropemaster with no other creature in play, so nothing is returned (up to one: none). On turn 4 Bot2
# taps its Llanowar Elves for mana (and leaves Grizzly Bears untapped); on turn 5 the second Ropemaster's trigger refuses the
# untapped Bears (the filter), and returns the tapped Elves to Bot2's hand. The Bears and the
# first Ropemaster stay.

